Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:34.04,Italics-Top,Train Announcement,0,0,0,,Attention passengers: \Ntrain arriving on platform three.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:39.87,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,Nakadori Street Shopping District\NOgikubo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.85,0:01:53.47,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Mornin', Saneatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.47,0:01:57.39,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Hey...you're always \Nso energetic, Kazuhiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.39,0:02:00.39,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Man, you must really hate informatics!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.06,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Informatics...You mean computer class.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:05.28,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I'm just so bad at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.28,0:02:07.61,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,When it comes to computers, \Nyou're "Sorry-atsu"!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:08.40,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Shaddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:10.64,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Is Ryuta not here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:12.19,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,He's prolly late again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.19,0:02:14.59,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Enough talking, guys. Turn your PC on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.59,0:02:15.82,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:17.28,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:20.04,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,1)\pos(523,47)\fs17}Two left
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:20.04,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,1)\pos(324,43)}You are currently\Nlooking at this screen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.65,0:02:20.04,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:22.14,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.14,0:02:24.65,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,There's something weird on my screen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.65,0:02:25.96,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:26.96,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H12&\pos(605,6)}Two left
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:26.96,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,5)\fs30}You are currently\Nlooking at this screen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:32.76,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You mean the screen saver? \NPush any button to turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:34.17,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Didn't even come look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:35.45,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:37.78,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Anyway, Sato, find your seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:39.39,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Yessir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:41.41,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:42.75,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,You're late, Ryuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:43.99,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Hey, Tardy Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.99,0:02:45.82,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Shaddup, you Flunking Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.82,0:02:47.78,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Come on, that was a low blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:53.53,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:54.86,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:55.45,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:57.24,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,See ya tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:00.37,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I think I'll head home today, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:02.86,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Come on, you don't wanna hang out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:05.43,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Today's the anniversary \Nof my mom's death, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:09.49,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Is your dad still living overseas?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.49,0:03:12.25,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Yeah, he just transfers me \Nsome money from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:16.54,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Well, if you ever need \Nanything just lemme know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:18.09,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,We're best friends, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.45,0:03:19.76,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Ryuta...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:22.14,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.61,0:03:24.37,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,All right, see ya tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:25.64,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Yeah, see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:28.71,Default,Customer A,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:29.64,Default,Customer B,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:30.56,Default,Waitress,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:31.98,Default,Waiter,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:53.42,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\an2\b0\pos(320,166)\fs17}No signal detected
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:56.76,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Didn't we just buy this last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:03:58.88,Phone,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz331\fs30\pos(369,62)}Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:03:58.88,Phone,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz332\pos(310,208)}Calling
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:01.85,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,No answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:15.77,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Why's it so quiet today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.87,0:04:22.37,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Ryuta... I should go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:29.46,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I wonder if his parents \Nalready left for work...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:32.38,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,He's definitely still passed out in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:35.38,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Can't be helped...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:43.38,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Ryuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:48.79,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Hey, Ryuta! What's wrong?! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:54.73,Phone,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\fs30\b0\frz25\fax0.1\pos(232,29)}Ippy-hiko\N{\fs18}Incoming Call
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.98,0:05:01.66,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Hey, Saneatsu?! Thank god!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:05.29,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Kazuhiko! Get help! \NSomething's wrong with Ryuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:06.78,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Ryuta, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:13.20,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Saneatsu. \NRyuta's probably already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.32,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You made it, Saneatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:22.26,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:26.28,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,What's all this about? \NWhat the hell's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:32.99,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I'm Yagihashi, president of the \Nstudent council. Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:36.86,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I'll cut to the chase. None of us \Nhave any idea what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:38.31,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,What the hell do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.31,0:05:40.66,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Our families are all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:46.58,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,We're most likely the only ones \Nleft alive from this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:53.58,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Saneatsu Narita...You saw the state \Nof our town on your way here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:02.41,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,We can't contact the police, the fire department, anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.22,0:06:05.75,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It's reasonable to conclude they're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:09.31,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Dead? Everyone in town...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:14.63,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I woke up and found my \Nentire family dead, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:16.49,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Kazuhiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:22.28,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,We don't know what happened, but \Nthe fact is people all over town are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:27.95,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,The ten people here are the only ones\Nwe've been able to contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.95,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,The others are likely...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:31.95,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,School Contact List
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:36.75,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1)\fs21\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H12&\pos(531,44)}One left
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.75,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\pos(320,105)\fs30}Japanese citizens living in Tokyo Prefecture
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:34.91,Default,Kaido,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.91,0:06:36.75,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,No, that wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:38.48,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,This is yesterday's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:40.77,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,No, it's a different question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:43.55,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Wait, you saw the same thing, Pres?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:44.87,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I saw it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:46.57,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I did, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:47.73,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:52.06,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,You mean, everyone here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:55.92,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What was yesterday's question?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:58.31,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H12&\pos(605,6)}Two left
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:58.31,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,5)\fs30}You are currently\Nlooking at this screen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.82,0:06:57.93,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I think it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:06:59.31,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs21\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H12&\pos(531,44)}One left
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:06:59.31,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,105)\fs30}Japanese citizens living in Tokyo Prefecture
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:00.98,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,It disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:05.82,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's not connected to the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.78,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(335,33)\c&H646260&\1a&H4E&\3c&H646260&\3a&HF8&\b0\fs25}Network signal
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.78,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H646260&\1a&H4E&\3c&H646260&\3a&HF8&\b0\pos(382,303)}Disconnected
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:09.23,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,In fact, there's no internet signal at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:10.96,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Fujishiro-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:11.74,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.11,0:07:15.02,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask of you\Nas Student Council Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.98,0:07:23.16,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Still no good....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:26.17,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:29.64,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,So we've got no gas, but \Nwe can use water and electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:31.60,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The radio seems to be working.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.60,Flashback_Italics,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,All right, everyone. Let's all wait at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:38.31,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Go home and gather your things \Nto meet up again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:42.98,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,But promise me you'll come back here. \NFor your own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:45.15,Flashback_Italics,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,We'll find answers tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:48.99,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.59,0:07:56.93,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I'll be taking roll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:08:00.25,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,First-year, Class D. Saaya Fujishiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:03.34,Default,Kaido,0,0,0,,Second-year, Class B. Mika Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:06.17,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,First-year, Class C. Omi Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:08.80,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Second-year, Class A. Eren Kunashiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:11.89,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Third-year, Class F. Ryohei Sudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:16.09,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I teach the first-year information \Nprocessing class, Sotaro Shinozaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:16.94,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,First-year, Class A—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:19.39,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Hang on! Where's the President?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.57,0:08:24.07,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,The President is... dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:31.20,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,He left a message for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:33.83,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,What do you mean "dead"?! \NHe killed himself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:36.06,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,At a time like this?! You gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:37.89,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.15,0:08:42.25,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,According to the President's theory, \Nthis was the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:45.13,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,The question displayed \Non the computer screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:47.01,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The question?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:48.88,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,The question from two days ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:48.88,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H12&\pos(605,6)}Two left
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:48.88,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,5)\fs30}You are currently\Nlooking at this screen
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:50.76,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,And the question from yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:50.76,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs21\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H12&\pos(531,44)}One left
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:50.76,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,105)\fs30}Japanese citizens living in Tokyo Prefecture
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:54.15,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Both were asked in a "yes" or "no" format.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:58.14,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,None of us clicked on an answer, \Nbut the President said...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:00.52,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I commute from Saitama Prefecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.89,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,If these questions really are \Nthe reason people are dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:06.04,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,then either me or all of you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:08.08,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,That's hardly scientific!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:09.75,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,But come to think of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.37,0:09:14.05,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,If people who were on the "no" side \Nof the first question were the ones to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:12.61,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H12&\pos(605,6)}Two left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:12.61,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,5)\fs30}You are currently\Nlooking at this screen
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.05,0:09:16.16,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,everything so far would make sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:22.25,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Then ya mean people who didn't \Nsee the first screen are all dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:25.01,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Another question?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.01,0:09:26.46,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Hang on, something's different!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:27.96,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H12&\fs18\pos(531,47)}Zero left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:27.96,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,50)\fs30}Test run complete
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:27.96,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,255)\fs30}Rules will be announced tonight at 23:40
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:29.58,Default,Kaido,0,0,0,,It's... not a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:32.68,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wait a second, what do \Nthey mean by "test run"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:32.01,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fs50\b1\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H23&\bord1}Test run
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:37.68,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H12&\fs18\pos(531,47)}Zero left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:37.68,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,50)\fs30}Test run complete
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:37.68,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,255)\fs30}Rules will be announced tonight at 23:40
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:38.13,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Either way, this means there \Nwill be another message tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:42.69,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,So we're starting to grasp what's happening, \Nbut my mind can't keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:47.18,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Sensei, can you open the conference room? \NWe'll all be able to see if we use a projector!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.18,0:09:48.90,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You're right. Let's get set up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:51.20,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Is any of this real?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:53.41,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Do we have everyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:56.34,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Hey, wasn't there \Nanother guy here yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:57.85,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I didn't see him during the day, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.85,0:10:01.75,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean that stuck-up guy? \NMaybe he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.05,0:10:03.42,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Did anyone call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:06.71,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Actually, we can't find \Nthe contact list...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:11.28,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Either way, there's no service network \Nanymore for calls or messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.01,Phone,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz327\b0\fs22\pos(307,173)\c&HE0BD26&}Phone service unavailable
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:15.97,Default,Kaido,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:19.75,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I guess we'll just have to give up \Non contacting each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.75,0:10:24.23,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Does it matter if we can't use it? \NWe're the only ones alive, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:26.22,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,We don't know that for sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.11,0:10:29.11,Phone,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\b0\fs22\pos(320,73)\c&HE0BD26&}Phone service unavailable
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:30.57,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,If only this was some terrible joke...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:30.57,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H12&\fs18\pos(531,47)}Zero left
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:30.57,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,50)\fs30}Test run complete
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:30.57,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)\pos(320,255)\fs30}Rules will be announced tonight at 23:40
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:35.41,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,What am I saying?! People are dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:41.41,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Congratulations. You are all alive by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:44.87,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, I'm the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:51.17,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,For the one million of you still alive in Tokyo, \Nthe test run has concluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.26,0:10:54.36,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,We will now begin the Tasuketsu (Absent Majority).
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.26,0:10:55.18,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs50\t(\fs25)\b1\c&HFFFFDE&\1a&H23&\bord1\move(317,21,317,130)}Tasuketsu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.93,0:10:57.14,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Tasuketsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:10:58.01,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fs50\b1\c&HFFFFDE&\1a&H23&\bord1\pos(535,163)\3c&HFFFFFF&}Absent
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:10:59.72,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,"Absent" majority?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:01.93,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs25\b1\c&HFFFFDE&\1a&H23&\bord1\pos(320,129)}Tasuketsu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.03,0:11:01.83,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,The rules are simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:06.10,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,All of you must search for \Nblue postboxes or red PCs
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:08.69,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,in Designated Areas that change daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:13.32,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1100,1)\pos(470,22)}You
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:12.16,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Submit a question with two possible answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:19.17,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Questions including designations of individual \Npeople or previously featured questions
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:21.33,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,Questions with designated individuals\NPreviously featured questions
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:21.09,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,will not be counted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:24.49,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,The first applicable question \Nsubmitted will be featured.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:23.79,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,750)\pos(470,22)}You
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:25.21,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(650,1)\pos(80,22)}1 accepted
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:28.48,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,The deadline is 23:55 PM daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:31.96,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,We will follow with announcements \Nof the featured question from 23:58 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:37.93,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,And every day at midnight, the majority \Nside of the two answers will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:42.31,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The majority were the ones dying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:48.13,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,If submissions are not accepted, a random \Nquestion will be selected from our library.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:49.52,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,This has to be a sick joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:54.21,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,That means, best case scenario, \Nhalf of those left will die...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:11:59.07,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Within Designated Areas, there \Nare also a total of 65 envelopes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:12:00.91,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,650)}Special Privilege         Privilege
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:04.84,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,that contain unique powers called \N"special privileges" and "privileges".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:08.58,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)}Special Privilege         Privilege
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:08.58,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Each person can obtain up to one of each.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:12.61,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Once obtained, you may not exchange \Nor modify your privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.61,0:12:14.11,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Please use them well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:16.55,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,...Sounds like a bunch of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:19.44,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Finally, when one person remains,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:23.04,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,they will be offered the privilege \Nof meeting the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:25.55,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The Emperor... So you'll meet us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.55,0:12:28.35,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Now, for the announcement \Nof tomorrow's Designated Area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.35,0:12:30.35,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)\pos(330,60)\fs40}Suginami Ward
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:39.49,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The leader will be Fujishiro, I'll be the \Nassistant leader, and the officer will be Sudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.94,0:12:39.95,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(294,25)}L               AL           O
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.94,0:12:39.95,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(12,84)}Fujishiro\N\N\N\N\N Sensei\N\N\N\N\NSudo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.94,0:12:39.95,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\pos(334,215)}1st place nationwide\Nin trial exams
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.37,0:12:43.06,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,It just so happens we're already in \Ntoday's Designated Area, Suginami Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:47.94,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Let's all search for red PCs or blue postboxes \Nand meet back up at 23:00 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:50.29,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(311,229)\3c&HE2DAD5&\c&H55493E&}Sidewalk
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.65,0:12:51.75,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,We're in this together. \NLet's all make it out alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.13,0:12:57.78,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,I can't believe we're doing this separately!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:13:00.68,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Idiots! You're all a bunch of idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:06.43,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,All the bodies are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:10.77,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,But my biggest question is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.59,0:13:14.40,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,Are there really a million people left?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:17.45,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,It's way too quiet for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.49,0:13:34.75,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,So? What's this you wanted to tell me \Nthat's more important than our search?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:37.75,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Since you're our leader and \Nthe successor to the President,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:41.62,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I wanted to tell you about my plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:46.39,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I'll take down the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:53.35,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,T-Take down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.35,0:13:55.95,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Making it out alive means nothing \Nif it means being alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:14:00.62,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,That's why surviving the Tasuketsu \Nisn't my purpose, it's my means...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.28,0:14:03.33,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,...to find the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:07.74,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,And there's no guarantee that \Nsomeone will be left in the end, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:10.56,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Like the Emperor said, \N"When one person remains,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:13.17,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,they'll be offered the privilege \Nof meeting the Emperor".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.17,0:14:14.75,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,But only "when one person remains".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.15,0:14:17.59,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,\NIf it's zero against everyone, we all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:21.09,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Since it's at least possible to meet \Nthe Emperor, they're around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:23.33,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,We've just gotta find them and stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:27.62,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,But there's problems with the Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.55,0:14:31.76,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The Emperor's only told us \Nthe absolute minimal rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:36.85,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,What happens if there's an equal \Nnumber of responses to a question, say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:41.03,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Does it not count, do both sides die, \Nor will there be some kind of adjustment?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:45.04,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The worst part is that we don't know what questions count and don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:46.71,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Can you ask any question you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.71,0:14:49.24,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,as long as the question \Nonly has two responses?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:54.11,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,What could the Emperor be thinking? \NOr are they not thinking at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:59.92,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,And why an "absent" majority? \NThere's so many mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:02.74,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Can I add something that's \Nbeen bothering me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:07.68,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,As of this morning, we have no gas, \Ninternet, or phone service.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.47,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(335,33)\c&H646260&\1a&H4E&\3c&H646260&\3a&HF8&\b0\fs25}Network signal
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.47,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H646260&\1a&H4E&\3c&H646260&\3a&HF8&\b0\pos(382,303)}Disconnected
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:07.68,Phone,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz327\b0\fs22\pos(307,173)\c&HE0BD26&}Phone service unavailable
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.07,0:15:11.41,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,But we still have electricity, \Nwater, and radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:14.31,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I think this could mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:16.61,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,This morning... Morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:17.85,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,"Morning"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:21.23,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,No, I was just remembering \Nthe morning two days ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:24.74,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,It feels strange that you guys were so calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:29.37,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,It was all thanks to the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:33.80,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,He was the one who called us \Nand got us to meet up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:36.04,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,After that, he forced us \Nto contact people one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:36.04,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(270,1)\fs18\frz30\fax0.3\pos(276,56)}Suginami Second High School\N{\fs24}Contact List
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:41.83,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I was confused at first, but it's thanks \Nto him we were able to stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:47.26,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I think the President did it... \NFor us...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:49.43,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:53.54,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,How did the President come to Tokyo \Nwhen the trains were down
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:55.43,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,and he lived all the way out in Saitama?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:59.06,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,How did he arrive at the school \Nbefore everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:02.07,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Could the President have known...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:06.84,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,...that the Tasuketsu had already begun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:10.38,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Sa-ne-a-tsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:11.67,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:15.58,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Saneatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:18.46,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,W-w-why are you calling me \Nby name all the sudden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.86,0:16:20.84,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Relax, relax...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:26.05,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I mean... we don't know when we're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.85,0:16:29.41,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Might as well get close \Nto people in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:32.09,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,S-Saaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.09,0:16:33.10,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:38.85,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Anyways, I had no idea how smart you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.85,0:16:41.78,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I've got brains and athletic skill, \Nas they say in my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:46.11,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,But when it comes to computers, \NI'm "Sorry-atsu".
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:51.63,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,So I leave the PC stuff to you! \NI'll find postboxes and the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:59.56,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I'll help you find the Emperor! \NLet's work together, Saneatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:02.00,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:03.21,Default-Top,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,You can't hold my hand like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:05.17,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's um! Find stuff we can \Ntake back and use!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.17,0:17:07.21,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I guess I got too close...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.17,0:17:07.21,Default-Top,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,While we're here! \NOr would that be stealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.61,0:17:09.71,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,That reminds me... Paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:12.72,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's take something to write our \Nquestions on, like receipt paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:12.72,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}Privilege
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:19.10,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz319\pos(233,239)\bord0}Privilege
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.98,0:17:17.08,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Should we open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:19.10,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's wait until everyone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:22.12,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Since we couldn't find a postbox, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:30.03,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Nothing's here at the school. \NIt's not easy finding a laptop...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.35,0:17:32.74,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Probably better off \Ntrying postboxes instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:40.04,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I figured someone would be here at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:43.24,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Sudo-senpai?! Where did you get that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:45.21,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Like I'll tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:49.10,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,...I found it lying on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:51.34,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Wait, did you just?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:56.32,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I knew my theory was right... \NThe correct answer is to kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:58.68,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,That's how to stop the Tasuketsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:18:00.56,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Are you gonna shoot me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.56,0:18:02.02,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.02,0:18:03.48,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:08.63,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Found you! Great, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:10.07,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,We're going to the front entrance now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.07,0:18:11.12,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Kazuhiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.12,0:18:12.03,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:14.99,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Sudo-senpai's walking around with a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:22.00,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Narita! Fujishiro! Sato! Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:23.00,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.46,0:18:24.92,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Narita, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:28.67,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Stop, you idiot nerd!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:31.63,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Fine then, you'll be first...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:32.76,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:37.60,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.21,0:18:39.89,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I won't give up...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:43.60,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I've narrowed down where you are... Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:45.98,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I guess we can't go to school anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.91,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you guys are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.91,0:18:52.13,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Safe how?! Kaido hasn't come back \Nand no one found a postbox!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:53.44,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,We're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:57.16,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's keep looking! \NWe may still find one in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:19:01.03,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Sensei, could you take on \Nthe role of Officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:06.37,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Right, sure... But promise me \Nyou'll come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:07.29,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:10.58,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,"Find one in time," my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.27,0:19:14.60,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Saneatsu, let's take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:19.80,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I jokingly told my best friend \Nto "go to hell"...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:22.93,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Since he died, I've felt so guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.69,0:19:26.59,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I promised I'd at least avenge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:30.44,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Now look at me, not accomplishing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.45,0:19:34.10,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Saneatsu... Let's take a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:35.06,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:37.77,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,When, if not now? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:40.49,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Okay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:42.56,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Ready? Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:43.49,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:48.24,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Wow, Saaya. You're great at taking pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.24,0:19:49.73,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I'm only average.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:53.96,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,It's all about focusing on or \Nframing around the main shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.47,0:19:57.93,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,My cellphone isn't even cut out \Nto take selfies in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:20:02.69,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I've never cared... or needed to, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:05.50,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:10.15,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,I wish we could've taken one \Nwith the whole group.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.72,0:20:11.98,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The whole group...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:14.69,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Our group!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.03,0:20:24.24,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I can't believe we lost track of time...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:27.16,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's watch here. We can \Nmeet up with the group later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.29,0:20:28.16,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\an2\b0\pos(320,166)\fs17}No signal detected
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:34.42,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's time. We will now begin \Ntallying the majority.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:37.42,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,What's coming? \NWhat could the question be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:40.43,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,114)\fad(1,500)}Male or Female
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:41.20,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Whose idea was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:47.06,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Promise me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.47,0:20:49.02,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Whoever makes it out alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:52.98,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,...will take down the Emperor. Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:54.90,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,114)}Male or Female
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.18,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,We've passed midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:14.92,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)\pos(330,60)\fs40\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Nakano Ward
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:19.79,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Emperor!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.92,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)}Tomorrow
